# Directory spec for the `box` tree — in-repo Vynil package sources built into OCI images.

Spec: box

Purpose:
  Hold the Vynil package source trees maintained with the code: the shipped `vynil` system
  package that installs the controller stack into a cluster, and a minimal `test` package used
  as a build/round-trip fixture.

Structure:
  ./vynil/: The shipped `vynil` system package (specified by ./vynil/vynil.sdd)
  ./test/: Minimal example package exercising build/update/lint round-trips

Owns:
  ./test/**

Must:
  Keep each package source buildable by the agent with `agent package build` from the repository
    root.

Must not:
  Contain runnable cluster state; a box is package source, and deployment manifests belong to
    /deploy.
